This repository contains material derived from XMage
(https://github.com/magefree/mage), distributed under the MIT License (full
text below):

- oracle/compliance/manifests/*.json are derived from the set classes of
  XMage, Mage.Sets/src/mage/sets, at the commit named in each file's
  "xmage_ref".
- scenarios/xmageport/** are translations of XMage Mage.Tests test methods
  (each scenario's "xmage" field names the originating Class#method; see
  scenarios/xmageport/NOTICE).

oracle/xmageoracle/ (the Java replay driver) is gorge's own code, compiled
against an out-of-tree XMage build; no XMage source is committed here.

Forge (https://github.com/Card-Forge/forge) card scripts, token scripts and
every Forge artifact are GPL-3.0 and are NEVER committed to this repository.
The corpus is read at run time from a gitignored .cards link to gorge's
corpus; internal/boundary fails the build if any Forge content is tracked or
one `git add` away from it.

Card names are used for identification only. Card rules (Oracle) text is not
committed: tools that print it (cmd/oraclepacket) write to gitignored paths.

